---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Sidereal Mythology: Astro-Theology & The Clockwork | Hub IV"
  description="Confront the crushing, mechanical gravity of the physical universe. Discover how ancient mystery schools encoded the exact parameters of the Archontic prison into the mythologies of the Stellar Cult."
>
  <main class="site-wrapper section theme-denying" style="padding-top: 40px;">
      
    <!-- WAYFINDING CONDUIT -->
    <nav class="shsq-wayfinding-conduit reveal" aria-label="Hub Navigation" style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto 50px auto; padding: 0 20px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px;">
      <ul class="breadcrumb-trail" style="list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: flex; gap: 10px; font-family: var(--font-display); text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 0.85rem;">
        <li><a href="/the-escape-matrix/">&#8629; Master Grid</a></li>
        <li class="separator" aria-hidden="true" style="color: var(--shsq-muted);">/</li>
        <li class="current-node" aria-current="page" style="color: var(--shsq-parchment);">Hub IV: Sidereal Mythology</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="adjacent-node">
        <a href="/masonic-architecture/" style="font-family: var(--font-display); text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 0.85rem; letter-spacing: 1px; border-bottom: 1px solid currentColor; padding-bottom: 2px;">Engage Hub V &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- HUB HERO -->
    <header class="shsq-hub-hero reveal" style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 60px; max-width: 1200px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; padding: 0 20px;">
      <span class="archive-eyebrow" style="color: var(--shsq-silver); font-size: 0.95rem; letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; display: block; margin-bottom: 15px;">Hub IV &middot; The Holy-Denying Force</span>
      <h1 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem); margin: 0 0 25px 0; line-height: 1.1;">Sidereal Mythology</h1>
      <p style="color: var(--shsq-parchment); font-size: 1.2rem; line-height: 1.8; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
        The cosmic clockwork. Confront the crushing, mechanical gravity of the physical universe. Discover how ancient mystery schools encoded the exact parameters of the Archontic prison into the mythologies of the Stellar Cult. Guided by Sophia Mysterion, the Sovereign Theurgist decodes Astro-Theology, the Precession of the Equinoxes, and the Tarot to map the forces of fate and neutralize the structural resistance of the matrix.
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- PILLAR CLUSTER GRID (6 NODES) -->
    <div class="shsq-cluster-grid reveal reveal-delay-1" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap: 30px; margin-bottom: 80px; max-width: 1200px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; padding: 0 20px;">
        
      <!-- Pillar 1 -->
      <article class="shsq-cluster-card" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
        <span class="silo-eyebrow">Pillar 1: The Master Clock</span>
        <h3 style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 20px;">Precession of the Equinoxes</h3>
        <p style="flex-grow: 1; margin-bottom: 35px;">
          Investigate the 25,920-year cycle of the Great Year. Discover how ancient megalithic civilizations tracked the shifting axis of the Earth as the master metronome of the simulation.
        </p>
        <a href="/sidereal-mythology/precession-of-equinoxes/" class="btn btn-ghost" style="align-self: flex-start;">
          Enter the Source &rarr;
        </a>
      </article>

      <!-- Pillar 2 -->
      <article class="shsq-cluster-card" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
        <span class="silo-eyebrow">Pillar 2: The Solar Mythos</span>
        <h3 style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 20px;">Astro-Theology</h3>
        <p style="flex-grow: 1; margin-bottom: 35px;">
          Decode the dying and rising god archetypes. Reveal how the allegorical journeys of Osiris, Mithras, and Christ mechanically map the transit of the Sun through the Zodiac.
        </p>
        <a href="/sidereal-mythology/astro-theology/" class="btn btn-ghost" style="align-self: flex-start;">
          Enter the Source &rarr;
        </a>
      </article>

      <!-- Pillar 3 -->
      <article class="shsq-cluster-card" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
        <span class="silo-eyebrow">Pillar 3: The Archontic Prison</span>
        <h3 style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 20px;">Heimarmene &amp; Fate</h3>
        <p style="flex-grow: 1; margin-bottom: 35px;">
          Confront the heavy, gravitational mechanics of the planetary spheres. Understand how the uninitiated human nervous system is mechanically governed by the deterministic laws of universal fate.
        </p>
        <a href="/sidereal-mythology/heimarmene-and-fate/" class="btn btn-ghost" style="align-self: flex-start;">
          Enter the Source &rarr;
        </a>
      </article>

      <!-- Pillar 4 -->
      <article class="shsq-cluster-card" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
        <span class="silo-eyebrow">Pillar 4: The Cybernetic Map</span>
        <h3 style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 20px;">The Hermetic Tarot</h3>
        <p style="flex-grow: 1; margin-bottom: 35px;">
          Unpack the 78 keys of the Tarot. Deconstruct the Major and Minor Arcana as a portable, visual operating system designed to diagnose and navigate the friction of the physical matrix.
        </p>
        <a href="/sidereal-mythology/hermetic-tarot/" class="btn btn-ghost" style="align-self: flex-start;">
          Enter the Source &rarr;
        </a>
      </article>

      <!-- Pillar 5 -->
      <article class="shsq-cluster-card" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
        <span class="silo-eyebrow">Pillar 5: The Global Epochs</span>
        <h3 style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 20px;">The Yugas &amp; Astrological Ages</h3>
        <p style="flex-grow: 1; margin-bottom: 35px;">
          Trace the structural rise and fall of consciousness across the Aeons. Analyze the transition from the Age of Taurus to Pisces, and the impending frequency shift of the Aquarian Age.
        </p>
        <a href="/sidereal-mythology/yugas-and-ages/" class="btn btn-ghost" style="align-self: flex-start;">
          Enter the Source &rarr;
        </a>
      </article>

      <!-- Pillar 6 -->
      <article class="shsq-cluster-card" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
        <span class="silo-eyebrow">Pillar 6: Neutralizing the Clockwork</span>
        <h3 style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 20px;">Escaping the Wheel</h3>
        <p style="flex-grow: 1; margin-bottom: 35px;">
          Transition from passive victim to active navigator. Learn how to anticipate the mechanical friction of the Archons and utilize the Holy-Denying force as fuel for ascension.
        </p>
        <a href="/sidereal-mythology/escaping-the-wheel/" class="btn btn-ghost" style="align-self: flex-start;">
          Enter the Source &rarr;
        </a>
      </article>

    </div>

    <!-- TERMINAL PROMPT -->
    <aside class="shsq-terminal-prompt reveal" aria-labelledby="terminal-heading" style="max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto 80px auto; text-align: center;">
      <h2 id="terminal-heading">The Denial is Mapped</h2>
      <p style="color: var(--shsq-parchment); font-size: 1.15rem; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 40px; max-width: 700px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;">
        You have stared into the crushing machinery of the Demiurge. You understand the friction that opposes the Great Work. To transcend the astral clockwork, you must construct the internal Temple capable of withstanding this force. Proceed to the architectural phase.
      </p>
      <a href="/masonic-architecture/" class="btn btn-primary">
        Engage Hub V &#8599;
      </a>
    </aside>

    <footer class="shsq-footer-note reveal reveal-delay-2" style="text-align: center; color: var(--shsq-silver); font-size: 0.85rem; font-style: italic; border-top: 1px solid rgba(198, 166, 100, 0.2); padding-top: 30px; max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding-left: 20px; padding-right: 20px;">
      <p style="margin: 0;">History SQ: Decoding the Enneagrammatic Escape Plan &middot; Guided by Sophia Mysterion.</p>
    </footer>

  </main>
</Layout>